    "status": "active",
    "description": "Nimras\u2019s former teacher and experienced mage hunter. Retained an entrusted binding manuscript beyond its loan to help disable a living-caster hunt. Affectionate, practical, independent. Selected Glass Hounds setup supersedes the rejected survey purpose.",
